<metadata><name>Snowlands 1603 Crescent Trail Loop</name><desc>loop (ends 194 m from the start). 5.8 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/16/1603_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
